es":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"vR1fVrOGbQKETv-AlpeKTQ","review_id":"x0y4JjetwBNs9lWOZi_92w","date":"2018-07-07T14:17:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8885060548782349,"text_excerpt":"Wow! This place had so much options that I couldn't decide! The lady was very nice and told me the different flavors and which one was mostly popular. She even let us sample some to see if we liked it. My boyfriend and I shared one. We got the hurricane one and it had like a cherry flavor. This wasn't strong so you don't have to worry and you can drink on the streets in New Orleans! Also keep the bottle so you can refill it at a cheaper price."},{"business_id":"vR1fVrOGbQKETv-AlpeKTQ","review_id":"TPmu7tsWyCGdob3gshd1gA","date":"2018-04-04T01:56:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8775219321250916,"text_excerpt":"For what it is... a pseudo-clean tourist trap with overpriced boozy frozen drinks, Big Easy Daiquiris delivers the goods. The drinks actually proved to be tasty. I sampled the Peach Bellini, yet settled on the Piña Colada. The star of the show was the lady who was on duty on the day I visited (last Saturday afternoon in May). She was fun, engaged, and took a lot of pride in the business. She was very willing to offer a sample or two, as well as give opinions about the various options. With many similar competitors, this location of Big Easy has a star employee who makes the experience of ordering a rather ubiquitous frozen concoction a pleasurable one."},{"business_id":"vR1fVrOGbQKETv-AlpeKTQ","review_id":"Y6-qJK3LRquYLtcTA5nIig","date":"2019-06-21T19:42:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8612644672393799,"text_excerpt":"The servers were great and there's nothing like a strong daiquiri in this heat. 190 Antifreeze...190 octane for Florida folks is great."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vR1fVrOGbQKETv-AlpeKTQ","photo_id":"1_Ul67x21jm6zLk0CpF7kg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1_Ul67x21jm6zLk0CpF7kg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
